# Kraum, Violent Cacophony: "Flying" and "Whenever you cast your second spell each turn, put a +1/+1 counter on Kraum and
# draw a card." (CR 207.2c, 603.2). On turn 3 Bot1 casts a Mox Emerald (first spell: nothing), a Memnite (second: Kraum
# gets one counter and Bot1 draws an Island) and an Ornithopter (third: nothing more). Kraum ends a 3/4 flier with one
# counter, and Bot1 has one card in hand (the Island).

